{
  "an3.93:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.93 ",
  "an3.93:0.2": "10. Loṇakapallavagga ",
  "an3.93:0.3": "Pavivekasutta ",
  "an3.93:1.1": "“Tīṇimāni, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā pavivekāni paññāpenti. ",
  "an3.93:1.2": "Katamāni tīṇi? ",
  "an3.93:1.3": "Cīvarapavivekaṁ, piṇḍapātapavivekaṁ, senāsanapavivekaṁ. ",
  "an3.93:2.1": "Tatridaṁ, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā cīvarapavivekasmiṁ paññāpenti, sāṇānipi dhārenti, masāṇānipi dhārenti, chavadussānipi dhārenti, paṁsukūlānipi dhārenti, tirīṭānipi dhārenti, ajinampi dhārenti, ajinakkhipampi dhārenti, kusacīrampi dhārenti, vākacīrampi dhārenti, phalakacīrampi dhārenti, kesakambalampi dhārenti, vālakambalampi dhārenti, ulūkapakkhikampi dhārenti. ",
  "an3.93:2.2": "Idaṁ kho, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā cīvarapavivekasmiṁ paññāpenti. ",
  "an3.93:3.1": "Tatridaṁ, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā piṇḍapātapavivekasmiṁ paññāpenti. ",
  "an3.93:3.2": "Sākabhakkhāpi honti, sāmākabhakkhāpi honti, nīvārabhakkhāpi honti, daddulabhakkhāpi honti, haṭabhakkhāpi honti, kaṇabhakkhāpi honti, ācāmabhakkhāpi honti, piññākabhakkhāpi honti, tiṇabhakkhāpi honti, gomayabhakkhāpi honti, vanamūlaphalāhārā yāpenti pavattaphalabhojī. ",
  "an3.93:3.3": "Idaṁ kho, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā piṇḍapātapavivekasmiṁ paññāpenti. ",
  "an3.93:4.1": "Tatridaṁ, bhikkhave, aññatitthiyā paribbājakā